<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle mostly steady, thin -USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle mostly steady, thin -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade moderate and compared to the previous week feeder steers and heifers sold mostly steady on a thin test, USDA said. 55 percent over 600 lbs. Supply: 325.</p>
